       "title": "An Unmatched Prophet ",
       "prompt": "Moses, who led the Jews out of Egypt, is considered to have been the greatest prophet who ever lived and had a uniquely close relationship with God. The end of the book of Deuteronomy highlights Moses’s unparalleled prophetic status."
      },
